WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:09.000
B. Now listen to the rest of the conversation, then answer the questions.

00:09.000 --> 00:13.000
What about video games? What's your favorite game these days?

00:13.000 --> 00:16.000
Have you heard of Dragon Blast?

00:16.000 --> 00:20.000
Really? I love that game. It's a guilty pleasure of mine.

00:20.000 --> 00:23.000
Maybe we should play as a team sometime.

00:23.000 --> 00:26.000
I'm usually online during the afternoon on weekends.

00:26.000 --> 00:29.000
Message me and I'll invite you to join my party.

00:29.000 --> 00:31.000
What's the regular group you game with?

00:31.000 --> 00:34.000
There are four of us who regularly team up.

00:34.000 --> 00:37.000
What's the level of your strongest dragon?

00:37.000 --> 00:41.000
I have a level 7 Shadow Dragon with 300 XP.

00:41.000 --> 00:46.000
Wow, that's stronger than my best dragon.

